{"study_accession":"PRJNA1261290","secondary_study_accession":"SRP584332","title":"Effect of senescent cells on macrophage polarisation","description":"Senescent cells (SCs) accumulate with age and injury and express a pro-inflammatory/pro-fibrotic secretome, termed the senescence-associated secretory phenotype (SASP). Hence, accumulation of senscent cells can lead to inflammation and organ fibrosis.</p><p>To investigate effects of SASP factors on macrophage polarisation macrophages matured from healthy donor blood monocytes were exposed to control or senescent cell conditioning media for 24 hours. Senescent cell media was derived from human proximal tubular epithelial cells (PTECs) exposed to 10 Gy of ionising radiation to induce senescence in vitro.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":6,"study_labels":[],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN48417312","study_accession":"PRJNA1261290","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"Donor1_CM","description":"Donor1_Control","sex":"missing","geo_sample":"","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":5,"first_public":"2026-06-02","attributes":[["isolate","Donor1"],["age","adult"],["biomaterial_provider","Centre for Inflammation Research"],["collection_date","2024"],["geo_loc_name","United Kingdom"],["sex","missing"],["tissue","Blood"],["treatment","Donor1_CM"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR33513720","experiment_accession":"SRX28748239","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"PolyA","instrument_model":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000","read_count":100978355,"base_count":30293506500,"first_public":"2026-06-02","experiment_title":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000 sequencing: RNA-Seq of human macrophages treated with senescent cell media"},{"run_accession":"SRR33513721","experiment_accession":"SRX28748238","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"PolyA","instrument_model":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000","read_count":66062578,"base_count":19818773400,"first_public":"2026-06-02","experiment_title":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000 sequencing: R